sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.SetScanResponseData(<br>data=0x0A 0x08 'N''o''n''i''n''3''1''5''0')
    Note right of App: 0x0A = AD length (1 type + 9 name bytes),<br>0x08 = 'Shortened Local Name' AD type.<br>See Core Spec v6.3, Vol 3, Part C, Section 11
    Note right of Node: Fire-and-forget, no response
